      "source_file": "Liu-15-8.jpg",
      "width": 2715,
      "height": 2160,
      "sha256": "ef2d101a9724f8ca7fae9d44fef67c5b84c05df338952a6345fa8b2b5e3b2368"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-16-0.webp",
      "alt": "树荫外面，太阳已经很足",
      "caption": "树荫外面，太阳已经很足 · 摄影 / Arsenan",
      "source_file": "Liu-16-0.jpg",
      "width": 3024,
      "height": 4032,
      "sha256": "a4eab2ba88cbbf34b4ea5902a05ac244666eda231746db17c09d495580557e6d"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-16-2.webp",
      "alt": "树荫下的一段赛道",
      "caption": "树荫下的一段赛道 · 摄影 / Arsenan",
      "source_file": "Liu-16-2.jpg",
      "width": 2656,
      "height": 3542,
      "sha256": "8ffba4f94c52f27b88a1819e448e03388255bf9642a8ffd7acf165b91b7db93e"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><strong data-cn-tone=\"3\">高原</strong>也有影响。<strong data-cn-tone=\"1\">六盘水</strong>城区海拔不低，呼吸和腿的感觉跟平原不一样。再加上刚从美国回来不到一周，<strong data-cn-tone=\"0\">时差</strong>没完全倒好，比赛状态本来就一般。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-15-3.webp",
      "alt": "张开双臂，跑过镜头",
      "caption": "张开双臂，跑过镜头 · 摄影 / 赛事官方",
