      "width": 2752,
      "height": 4128,
      "sha256": "e4f3d2210f9b010e7dd6007937007b061676ebfad390d981679a0e93eebafd28"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-15-7.webp",
      "alt": "经过护栏旁的拍照点",
      "caption": "经过护栏旁的拍照点 · 摄影 / 赛事官方",
      "source_file": "Liu-15-7.jpg",
      "width": 4000,
      "height": 6000,
      "sha256": "3cdbda04a4e3996da9cd363886245791ccc6a8818abe915affd56abebddbfb3e"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>那双<strong data-cn-tone=\"3\">新鞋</strong>后半程也开始顶脚掌。装备、训练、海拔和天气全凑到一起，后面只能<strong data-cn-tone=\"2\" data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\">跑跑走走</strong>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-16-1.webp",
      "alt": "35公里，拍张照再走",
      "caption": "35公里，拍张照再走",
      "source_file": "Liu-16-1.jpg",
      "width": 4284,
      "height": 5712,
      "sha256": "51a1cdaacf26480a84f713c9e5a3de07171baa420f778c26ed8e7e0f12303d04"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-16-3.webp",
      "alt": "后半程，继续和镜头打招呼",
      "caption": "后半程，继续和镜头打招呼 · 摄影 / 赛事官方",
      "source_file": "Liu-16-3.jpg",
      "width": 3548,
      "height": 5317,
      "sha256": "4ecb25714bae6e45beeb2719440b3ac3ccec7cf0361d213ea35494844f0f973f"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最后大概<strong data-cn-tone=\"0\" data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\">五小时二十分</strong>冲线。这个成绩不快，但也没必要硬包装。当天的状态就是这样，能跑完就行。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-17-0.webp",
      "alt": "最后一段，慢慢往前跑",
      "caption": "最后一段，慢慢往前跑 · 摄影 / 赛事官方",
      "source_file": "Liu-17-0.jpg",
      "width": 1992,
      "height": 2990,
      "sha256": "4c3f4dbcd022969d65a1348c69be11c82cd0a10f832c1a40ed0fda9ded8bfc38"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-17-1.webp",
      "alt": "和其他跑者一起往终点去",
      "caption": "和其他跑者一起往终点去 · 摄影 / 赛事官方",
      "source_file": "Liu-17-1.jpg",
      "width": 2624,
      "height": 3499,
      "sha256": "127ccae48d53569db772c39a64ba606789a2482e0525c3c407f56dde44d401f8"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-17-2.webp",
      "alt": "再举一次手",
      "caption": "再举一次手 · 摄影 / 赛事官方",
      "source_file": "Liu-17-2.jpg",
