      "height": 4128,
      "sha256": "209ddf242122aef6c7132cdc8042379ce8f4cdd08d05edba8a45cef5519b6550"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>终点前大约<strong data-cn-tone=\"1\">五百米</strong>，<strong data-cn-tone=\"1\">摄影师</strong>非常多，感觉一小段路上站了一百多人。很多完赛照片，都是在这里拍的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
