      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-18-2.webp",
      "alt": "拿上奖牌，今天跑完了",
      "caption": "拿上奖牌，今天跑完了",
      "source_file": "Liu-18-2.jpg",
      "width": 2855,
      "height": 2644,
      "sha256": "598a8a856240827995abe5f57c46a49e9b62fc7cd3bc3157f3fd87f7fade1455"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "label": "返程路上",
      "title": "“火车站”成了跑者大Party"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛结束后回到<strong data-cn-tone=\"1\">水城古镇</strong>附近。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛前我就跟房东说，马拉松刚结束，能不能稍微晚一点退房。房东很爽快地答应了。都是普通小事，但旅行顺不顺，很多时候就看这些细节。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>从终点回<strong data-cn-tone=\"1\">水城古镇</strong>不算近，大概有几公里。封路还没完全解除，车不好叫。我走了挺久，才找到出租车。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-19-0.webp",
      "alt": "背好东西，准备赶下一程",
      "caption": "背好东西，准备赶下一程 · 摄影 / Arsenan",
      "source_file": "Liu-19-0.jpg",
      "width": 3650,
      "height": 2160,
      "sha256": "aa2f0455b69c04548021c379a89ebb45efccb68b70b9a2f7ea3b364c9c3fa7f2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>后来去火车站，里面几乎全是刚跑完的跑友。有人穿着赛事服，有人挂着奖牌，有人拖着箱子直接赶下一程。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-19-1.webp",
      "alt": "车站里都是刚跑完的跑者",
      "caption": "车站里都是刚跑完的跑者 · 摄影 / Arsenan",
      "source_file": "Liu-19-1.jpg",
      "width": 3520,
      "height": 2644,
      "sha256": "785c583fa8c0c68d2284743e2c49f2f40277dff4ba953c95e8cb1d1002e90853"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-19-2.webp",
      "alt": "六盘水站，准备返程",
      "caption": "六盘水站，准备返程 · 摄影 / Arsenan",
      "source_file": "Liu-19-2.jpg",
      "width": 4096,
      "height": 3072,
      "sha256": "1251e3ab51d692275a4f0d9fbd7a2b4f5722e156411e09f95bb7a7496fbb1e72"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>大家从全国各地来<strong data-cn-tone=\"1\">六盘水</strong>，跑完<strong data-cn-tone=\"0\">四十二公里</strong>，又坐上高铁回广州、武汉、江西、湖北和其他城市。接下来还是上班、工作、养家，生活照常继续。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这个周末很匆忙，但内容挺充实。<strong data-cn-tone=\"1\">水城古镇</strong>、<strong data-cn-tone=\"0\">乌蒙大草原</strong>、<strong data-cn-tone=\"2\">北盘江</strong>、<strong data-cn-tone=\"1\">海坪</strong><strong data-cn-tone=\"0\">火把季</strong>，再加上一场<strong data-cn-tone=\"3\">高原</strong>马拉松，基本没浪费时间。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><strong data-cn-tone=\"3\" data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\">跑的挺慢，但谁在乎呢？</strong>又晒黑了，那又咋地？</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/assets/runcn-liupanshui-2026/Liu-19-3.webp",
      "alt": "跑完马拉松，晚上接着看球",
      "caption": "跑完马拉松，晚上接着看球 · 摄影 / Arsenan",
      "source_file": "Liu-19-3.jpg",
      "width": 3777,
      "height": 3072,
      "sha256": "427fef07fad56aa71a38b0ed3716e35993260ea6d322f9fe4bc0ff45bd58d8c1"
    }
  ]
}